A host's filter over the presented picture (Melee-NX-NetPlay 0.4.9): webgpu::set_present_filter, called on the render worker with the frame's encoder, the picture (after the picture adjustments) and its size on screen, returning the texture to show (RetroArch shader presets, src/user_shader.cpp); the instance asks for SPIR-V shader sources (Dawn's SPIR-V reader). After 0109, 0125 and 0126.
